WEBVTT

01:01.600 --> 01:06.040
<i><b>The Witch Doctor</b></i>

01:07.350 --> 01:11.610
<b>When the creature of greatest darkness is
crushed by the power of the white spirit,</b>

01:11.610 --> 01:14.820
<b>it will vanish upon
Yawadvip's fire mountain.</b>

01:15.740 --> 01:22.080
<b>Say, what do you think about that
legend that Danas kid talked about?</b>

01:22.080 --> 01:25.920
<b>We're gonna hit up
every lead we find.</b>

01:25.920 --> 01:27.290
<b>No other choice.</b>

01:27.290 --> 01:29.210
<b>So, where's Yawadvip?</b>

01:29.210 --> 01:30.920
<b>Sumatra.</b>

01:30.920 --> 01:33.090
<b>That's what it was called
in ancient Roman times.</b>

01:35.090 --> 01:37.590
<b>Man, the boat's taking forever...</b>

01:39.550 --> 01:40.140
<b>Razor?</b>

01:43.850 --> 01:47.350
<b>Good evening, Mr. Daywalker.</b>

01:47.350 --> 01:48.650
<b>What the hell is that!?</b>

01:49.860 --> 01:51.320
<b>A familiar.</b>

01:51.320 --> 01:53.480
<b>The pure-bloods use them a lot.</b>

01:53.480 --> 01:55.340
<b>It's just a shadow.</b>

01:55.950 --> 01:59.320
<b>Human folklore continues
to impress me.</b>

01:59.320 --> 02:03.580
<b>Frost is indeed in
the Sumatran mountains.</b>

02:04.120 --> 02:07.410
<b>He's continuing his distasteful
experiments for the turned.</b>

02:08.120 --> 02:11.670
<b>If you don't hurry,
there will be more human casualties.</b>

02:22.640 --> 02:24.470
<b>You didn't need to ask.</b>

02:24.470 --> 02:26.680
<b>I'm going to kill Frost myself,</b>

02:26.680 --> 02:28.440
<b>and then I'm coming after you all.</b>

02:43.410 --> 02:47.290
Sumatra, Mount Sibayak

02:57.840 --> 03:00.030
<b>There's Existence's symbol.</b>

03:00.470 --> 03:02.010
<b>That settles it.</b>

03:02.010 --> 03:02.760
<b>Yeah.</b>

03:03.850 --> 03:05.350
<b>There's not a lot of guards...</b>

03:06.140 --> 03:08.790
<b>The explosives we got from Noah</b>

03:09.120 --> 03:10.840
<b>should make this easy.</b>

03:11.690 --> 03:12.650
<b>Please, wait!</b>

03:15.400 --> 03:18.570
<b>You two are vampire hunters, right?</b>

03:18.820 --> 03:19.990
<b>And you're?</b>

03:19.990 --> 03:22.070
<b>I'm Agus of the Battak tribe.</b>

03:22.740 --> 03:24.310
<b>I'm not your enemy.</b>

03:25.200 --> 03:28.620
<b>But I want you to wait before
you attack the mines.</b>

03:28.620 --> 03:29.750
<b>What?</b>

03:29.750 --> 03:34.460
<b>The men being forced to work
down there are from my village.</b>

03:34.460 --> 03:36.000
<b>Don't sweat it.</b>

03:36.000 --> 03:38.170
<b>We won't hurt them.</b>

03:38.170 --> 03:39.590
<b>Come on, Makoto.</b>

03:39.590 --> 03:40.260
<b>That's not it!</b>

03:41.510 --> 03:43.840
<b>Please, listen to me!</b>

03:43.840 --> 03:46.640
<b>There's something
I need you hunters to see!</b>

03:47.560 --> 03:48.520
<b>Follow me!</b>

03:51.560 --> 03:53.560
<b>It was a few days ago...</b>

03:53.560 --> 03:57.320
<b>a group wanting to open
a silver mine showed up,</b>

03:57.320 --> 03:59.900
<b>and took almost everyone
in the village.</b>

04:00.690 --> 04:03.360
<b>They're having humans
dig up silver?</b>

04:03.360 --> 04:07.160
<b>But silver is toxic to vampires.</b>

04:07.160 --> 04:08.540
<b>Why would they want it?</b>

04:08.540 --> 04:10.200
<b>I don't know.</b>

04:11.120 --> 04:12.540
<b>All I know...</b>

04:13.710 --> 04:18.710
<b>is that I was able to
get my wife back.</b>

04:23.130 --> 04:24.890
<b>This is my home.</b>

04:25.470 --> 04:26.720
<b>Where's your wife?</b>

04:28.060 --> 04:29.470
<b>She's sleeping over here.</b>

04:47.070 --> 04:49.010
<b>This is my wife, Yati.</b>

04:49.540 --> 04:54.250
<b>When I brought her back from the mines,
she had already been turned.</b>

04:54.990 --> 04:56.150
<b>Wait!</b>

04:59.040 --> 05:00.370
<b>Look closely.</b>

05:04.430 --> 05:05.680
<b>No fangs!?</b>

05:06.430 --> 05:07.430
<b>What's going on?</b>

05:07.430 --> 05:09.600
<b>They went away,
with treatment.</b>

05:09.600 --> 05:10.970
<b>Treatment?</b>

05:10.970 --> 05:15.520
<b>The holy water that I've been able to bless
can turn someone who's become a vampire</b>

05:15.520 --> 05:17.690
<b>into a human again.</b>

05:17.690 --> 05:18.730
<b>What!?</b>

05:21.610 --> 05:24.080
<b>I'm this village's shaman.</b>

05:41.630 --> 05:43.190
<b>Do you see?</b>

05:44.300 --> 05:49.760
<b>The rest of the village's women
are being held at that mine as well.</b>

05:49.760 --> 05:50.680
<b>No way...</b>

05:50.680 --> 05:52.260
<b>were they all turned!?</b>

05:52.640 --> 05:54.200
<b>It seems likely.</b>

05:55.850 --> 05:59.230
<b>This is the same kind of
holy water I created.</b>

05:59.520 --> 06:02.610
<b>You're gonna use that to
turn them human again?</b>

06:02.610 --> 06:03.480
<b>Yes.</b>

06:04.900 --> 06:09.910
<b>I've had to change the water every day,
to adjust the purification levels.</b>

06:11.280 --> 06:14.620
<b>If I keep the treatment up,
I know it should work.</b>

06:14.620 --> 06:17.330
<b>Your little fantasy can't
save anything.</b>

06:18.870 --> 06:20.540
<b>But look at her!</b>

06:21.250 --> 06:22.590
<b>Give it up.</b>

06:22.590 --> 06:26.760
<b>Once you're a vampire,
there is no cure.</b>

06:26.760 --> 06:28.220
<b>I don't believe that!</b>

06:28.220 --> 06:30.430
<b>My treatment will work!</b>

06:31.180 --> 06:35.020
<b>She's still asleep now,
but with more time--</b>

06:35.020 --> 06:38.020
<b>I don't have time to listen to this.</b>

06:38.020 --> 06:38.600
<b>Wait!</b>

06:39.370 --> 06:41.060
<b>Please, listen to me!</b>

06:46.360 --> 06:47.900
<b>Alright, stop.</b>

06:47.900 --> 06:51.410
<b>Time for tonight's visitation hours.</b>

06:56.330 --> 06:58.750
<b>Come on out, Sundel Belong!</b>

06:58.750 --> 07:00.290
<b>It's time for dinner!</b>

07:21.350 --> 07:22.440
<b>Turn a vampire...</b>

07:23.400 --> 07:25.980
<b>back into a human?</b>

07:30.650 --> 07:31.700
<b>It's idiotic.</b>

07:33.070 --> 07:36.990
<b>I'm not gonna buy some fairy tale.</b>

07:37.950 --> 07:39.500
<b>It's not possible.</b>

07:56.930 --> 08:00.810
<b>Good evening, Mr. Daywalker.</b>

08:05.730 --> 08:09.490
<b>I apologize for not greeting you
in person the other day.</b>

08:09.490 --> 08:11.950
<b>I am Lucius Isaac.</b>

08:11.920 --> 08:13.930
<b>It's a pleasure to make
your acquaintance.</b>

08:14.320 --> 08:17.160
<b>I must ask,
what exactly are you doing?</b>

08:17.160 --> 08:19.700
<b>Please, dismantle their
mining operation, quickly.</b>

08:24.290 --> 08:26.380
<b>You seem upset.</b>

08:27.380 --> 08:29.630
<b>And you're hesitating.</b>

08:29.630 --> 08:34.260
<b>At this rate, you'll pose
no threat to us in the nobility.</b>

08:43.640 --> 08:46.360
<b>So, when's your wife gonna wake up?</b>

08:47.110 --> 08:49.110
<b>She just needs time...</b>

08:49.110 --> 08:50.550
<b>more time.</b>

08:56.530 --> 09:01.660
<b>I have to say, that Agus fellow
is quite the dreamer.</b>

09:01.660 --> 09:05.080
<b>Humans are so foolish,
don't you think?</b>

09:05.370 --> 09:11.130
<b>There's no way that a human who has
been turned could ever change back.</b>

09:12.510 --> 09:18.890
<b>Oh my, have you actually bought
into that man's fairy tale?</b>

09:19.100 --> 09:22.680
<b>You, who killed his own mother.</b>

09:29.310 --> 09:31.690
<b>That face filled with regret...</b>

09:31.690 --> 09:33.670
<b>truly amusing.</b>

09:43.620 --> 09:44.410
<b>Makoto!</b>

09:50.540 --> 09:51.880
<b>You two, stay back!</b>

09:52.890 --> 09:55.000
<b>I've lost interest.</b>

09:55.000 --> 09:57.400
<b>Today's games are over, I'd say.</b>

09:57.840 --> 10:01.510
<b>I hope you do a better job of
entertaining me next time.</b>

10:08.520 --> 10:09.940
<b>Dammit.</b>

10:09.940 --> 10:11.270
<b>What a joke.</b>

10:11.480 --> 10:16.280
<b>That stuck up vampire priss
isn't all that...</b>

10:17.030 --> 10:19.450
<b>He just ran off because
the sun was coming up.</b>

10:23.540 --> 10:25.580
<b>Ow, ow, ow...</b>

10:27.410 --> 10:30.290
<b>I'm bruised all over.</b>

10:30.290 --> 10:31.920
<b>He's a pure-blood.</b>

10:32.540 --> 10:34.300
<b>You can't handle one of them.</b>

10:35.050 --> 10:36.300
<b>Just be glad you survived.</b>

10:36.300 --> 10:39.930
<b>The same goes for you, man.</b>

10:42.300 --> 10:43.780
<b>That shaman...</b>

10:46.430 --> 10:48.350
<b>That Agus...</b>

10:49.940 --> 10:51.560
<b>what do you think?</b>

10:52.480 --> 10:53.790
<b>What do you mean?</b>

10:54.190 --> 10:58.570
<b>About turning a vampire
back into a human.</b>

11:03.740 --> 11:05.310
<b>Well...</b>

11:07.040 --> 11:11.380
<b>I guess that'd be great,
if he could pull it off.</b>

11:12.290 --> 11:15.460
<b>It's kind of hard to buy though.</b>

11:16.090 --> 11:19.220
<b>I mean,
a cure for <i>that</i>?</b>

11:20.510 --> 11:26.140
<b>I've lived to kill them,
ever since I put down my mother.</b>

11:26.140 --> 11:29.180
<b>I hoped that one day
I could end it permanently.</b>

11:29.180 --> 11:32.600
<b>I thought that I was maintaining
my humanity by doing that.</b>

11:33.580 --> 11:37.980
<b>I even killed your father.</b>

11:40.240 --> 11:42.590
<b>Yeah, you did.</b>

11:43.070 --> 11:45.240
<b>You killed my old man.</b>

11:47.910 --> 11:48.870
<b>But still...</b>

11:50.000 --> 11:57.500
<b>if you didn't kill him,
I'd be a vampire right now...</b>

11:58.460 --> 12:00.510
<b>just like your mom.</b>

12:03.800 --> 12:05.240
<b>You can't let it stop you.</b>

12:05.470 --> 12:10.430
<b>If we stop now,
that'll mean more vampires.</b>

12:10.430 --> 12:14.150
<b>I'm not gonna wait while
there's more casualties.</b>

12:14.900 --> 12:16.150
<b>I'll fight.</b>

12:19.110 --> 12:20.400
<b>Don't let it bother you.</b>

12:22.700 --> 12:26.620
<b>I'm a vampire hunter, and right now,
I'm your partner.</b>

12:27.160 --> 12:30.620
<b>It's our job to take down
their base, right?</b>

12:34.080 --> 12:34.880
<b>Yeah.</b>

12:35.630 --> 12:36.460
<b>You know it.</b>

12:41.800 --> 12:42.470
<b>Let's go.</b>

12:57.520 --> 12:58.400
<b>Yati!</b>

13:08.530 --> 13:09.870
<b>Get moving!</b>

13:09.870 --> 13:11.870
<b>The overseers all ran off!</b>

13:11.870 --> 13:13.910
<b>Let's get out of here,
before the big guns find out!</b>

13:24.050 --> 13:25.630
<b>What're you doing?</b>

13:25.630 --> 13:27.720
<b>Yati ran off!</b>

13:27.720 --> 13:31.720
<b>I'm sure that she was drawn to this place,
since she's not cured yet!</b>

13:32.520 --> 13:36.020
<b>She was still under treatment,
so it's my responsibility!</b>

13:36.600 --> 13:41.530
<b>Swear to me you won't kill Yati
if you find her first!</b>

13:43.610 --> 13:45.220
<b>I can't do that.</b>

13:45.280 --> 13:48.660
<b>She wants to return to her old life!</b>

13:48.660 --> 13:51.120
<b>You have to listen to her soul's voice!</b>

13:51.790 --> 13:55.600
<b>Becoming a vampire is
like losing your soul.</b>

13:56.460 --> 14:01.090
<b>What you're doing is like
putting makeup on a corpse.</b>

14:01.090 --> 14:02.630
<b>That's not true!</b>

14:02.630 --> 14:04.920
<b>Then why'd she run?</b>

14:06.970 --> 14:09.240
<b>You've realized it by now.</b>

14:10.220 --> 14:12.310
<b>Accept the truth.</b>

14:12.310 --> 14:16.890
<b>She's left you,
and come back here.</b>

14:16.890 --> 14:18.270
<b>That's reality.</b>

14:33.760 --> 14:35.140
<b>Yati!</b>

14:40.500 --> 14:41.670
<b>Yati...</b>

14:42.540 --> 14:43.480
<b>Yati!</b>

14:45.170 --> 14:46.630
<b>You poor thing...</b>

14:46.630 --> 14:47.760
<b>you must have been scared.</b>

14:48.300 --> 14:50.180
<b>It's okay now...</b>

14:50.180 --> 14:52.470
<b>let's go home.</b>

14:58.440 --> 14:59.690
<b>I warned him.</b>

14:59.690 --> 15:01.000
<b>Wait!</b>

15:01.810 --> 15:03.060
<b>Yati...</b>

15:03.060 --> 15:04.270
<b>look at this!</b>

15:05.230 --> 15:09.200
<b>You gave this to me when
we were married!</b>

15:09.200 --> 15:11.010
<b>Remember, Yati!</b>

15:32.220 --> 15:33.530
<b>Yati...</b>

15:42.400 --> 15:43.540
<b>Yati...</b>

15:54.280 --> 15:56.120
<b>The workers are all free!</b>

16:07.090 --> 16:08.510
<b>What're you doing!?</b>

16:08.510 --> 16:10.380
<b>Go after Frost!</b>

16:11.010 --> 16:13.430
<b>Leave them to me and Razor!</b>

16:13.430 --> 16:14.140
<b>Take care of it.</b>

16:15.850 --> 16:17.720
<b>Over here, bitches!</b>

16:28.400 --> 16:29.400
<b>Old man!</b>

16:29.400 --> 16:30.280
<b>You alright?</b>

16:32.320 --> 16:34.010
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

16:35.660 --> 16:41.290
<b>In the end,
I couldn't even save my wife.</b>

16:41.290 --> 16:44.290
<b>And I dragged you two into this.</b>

16:47.210 --> 16:47.840
<b>Razor?</b>

16:50.170 --> 16:52.300
<b>Shit, there's no end to them.</b>

16:53.300 --> 16:55.800
<b>I have to ask you something.</b>

16:55.800 --> 16:59.810
<b>Sorry, but you've been bitten,
so I can't let you live.</b>

17:00.520 --> 17:02.600
<b>Take me and the people
of the village...</b>

17:03.480 --> 17:06.440
<b>to the nearby spring.</b>

17:07.110 --> 17:08.170
<b>Spring?</b>

17:09.020 --> 17:12.360
<b>While I'm still human...</b>

17:14.280 --> 17:15.450
<b>Blade.</b>

17:18.530 --> 17:20.200
<b>I've been waiting for you.</b>

17:20.950 --> 17:23.250
<b>I'm Solanin.</b>

17:23.250 --> 17:25.960
<b>I run this mine.</b>

17:25.960 --> 17:28.130
<b>Where's Deacon Frost?</b>

17:28.630 --> 17:33.550
<b>A little arrogant of you to mention
that name in this situation, isn't it?</b>

17:34.550 --> 17:35.380
<b>No...</b>

17:35.800 --> 17:39.220
<b>But you won't be leaving here alive.</b>

17:39.220 --> 17:44.270
<b>Enjoy the full extent of this power
that Master Frost has given me.</b>

18:14.420 --> 18:18.300
<b>Your little sword's useless against me!</b>

18:29.310 --> 18:30.060
<b>They're here!</b>

18:31.270 --> 18:36.110
<b>My sisters, if there's no saving you,
let it at least end by my hand.</b>

18:50.670 --> 18:51.760
<b>Forgive me.</b>

19:19.450 --> 19:22.240
<b>I think it's time for me to end this.</b>

19:39.760 --> 19:43.220
<i>THE
SECOND
BLADE</i>

19:40.300 --> 19:43.220
<i>PHANTOM
MOON</i>

20:00.860 --> 20:03.010
<b>Pops, that was amazing!</b>

20:04.370 --> 20:05.350
<b>Stay back.</b>

20:06.910 --> 20:09.660
<b>This entire spring is holy water now.</b>

20:13.670 --> 20:18.210
<b>Holy water that can be
used against vampires...</b>

20:18.210 --> 20:20.030
<b>take it with you.</b>

20:21.670 --> 20:25.430
<b>You'll at least be able to save the souls
of those who have lost their lives.</b>

20:26.510 --> 20:27.430
<b>Goodbye.</b>

20:57.790 --> 20:59.340
<b>Where are we headed next?</b>

21:00.800 --> 21:04.550
<b>A place where people who
don't fear vampires gather.</b>

21:05.720 --> 21:07.970
<b>The worst place in the world.</b>

21:10.520 --> 21:11.950
<b>I don't care.</b>

21:13.430 --> 21:14.240
<b>Let's go.</b>

23:03.290 --> 23:07.420
<b>I swear, I'm going to make
my way up from Lowtown,</b>

23:07.420 --> 23:10.220
<b>and teach those bastards
in Hightown who I am!</b>

23:10.720 --> 23:12.220
<b>This is Madripoor.</b>

23:13.100 --> 23:14.760
<b>A lawless island.</b>

23:15.810 --> 23:18.080
<b>No cops, not even any military.</b>

23:18.640 --> 23:20.420
<b>So, Blade...</b>

23:20.690 --> 23:21.900
<b>This your sweetheart?</b>

23:24.290 --> 23:25.910
<b>Answer me, Logan! Answer me, Blade!</b>

23:26.150 --> 23:31.030
<i><b>The Daywalker and the Mutant</b></i>

23:26.730 --> 23:30.490
<b>Next time on Blade:
The Daywalker and the Mutant.</b>
